error[E0322]: `distinct` types need a name
  --> tests/ui/const_errors.wid:11:6
   |
11 |   x: distinct F64 = 1.0
   |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^ a `distinct` type is declared once, as a constant
   = note: each `distinct` declaration creates a new type, so an unnamed one could never match another
help: declare it at package level, like `Meters = distinct F64`, then use `Meters`
